he incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying, and INC-0001 had been created, so I didn't send it again and there's no duplicate page. It describes what happened, the rollback including the halted first attempt, and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed and look into the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}